# What NOT to upload on `vercel deploy`.
#
# This file replaces .gitignore for the upload rather than adding to it, so
# build output and dependencies have to be named here too — leaving .next out
# meant uploading 419MB of local build on every deploy, and the deployment sat
# in "Initializing" until it gave up.
#
# Leading slashes matter: a bare `supabase/` matches a directory of that name at
# any depth, which silently excluded src/lib/supabase/ and broke the build with
# "Can't resolve '@/lib/supabase/server'".

# Built on Vercel, never uploaded.
/.next/
/node_modules/

# A read-only comparison copy that only the equivalence test imports.
/design_handoff_capital_call_engine 2/

# Migrations, sample workbooks and local tooling: not part of the app bundle.
/supabase/
/samples/
/.claude/
/.git/

# TypeScript incremental caches, rebuilt on demand.
*.tsbuildinfo
